WEBVTT

00:11.180 --> 00:14.280
[Fenglinwan]

00:15.080 --> 00:18.500
[Two years ago]

00:16.320 --> 00:17.650
Who do you think you are?

00:18.960 --> 00:21.220
You're not drinking the toast I propose?

00:28.920 --> 00:29.660
Zhao,

00:30.550 --> 00:31.960
I'll drink with you.

00:32.600 --> 00:34.240
Rong had antibiotics today.

00:35.030 --> 00:35.430
Here.

00:39.430 --> 00:40.040
What?

00:40.110 --> 00:40.750
Scared you?

00:40.750 --> 00:41.610
Come on, drink.

00:42.200 --> 00:42.700
Drink.

00:42.790 --> 00:43.520
Let's drink.

00:43.520 --> 00:44.200
You two drink it all up.

00:44.200 --> 00:44.670
Okay.

00:51.880 --> 00:53.320
Who do you think you are?

00:55.150 --> 00:56.480
Have you forgotten how,

00:56.640 --> 00:58.170
in order to get the project,

00:58.200 --> 00:58.840
you gave your girlfriend

00:58.840 --> 00:59.670
to me?

01:03.470 --> 01:05.269
We can be considered relatives.

01:06.400 --> 01:06.910
Zhao,

01:07.040 --> 01:08.100
what are you doing?

01:08.110 --> 01:09.150
Let's talk outside.

01:09.150 --> 01:09.680
Let's go.

01:09.870 --> 01:10.470
Calm down.

01:10.510 --> 01:11.230
Let's go.

02:40.079 --> 02:43.880
[Born with Luck]

02:43.910 --> 02:46.890
[Episode 23]

02:52.590 --> 02:53.150
Bro.

02:53.840 --> 02:55.440
Do you know what I'm here for?

02:57.630 --> 02:58.829
What are you here for?

02:59.190 --> 03:00.700
To get money.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.610
Who is your boss?

03:21.870 --> 03:23.420
It's you, Rong.

03:31.190 --> 03:32.520
You're quite stubborn.

03:33.000 --> 03:34.079
If my boss is not you,

03:34.079 --> 03:35.120
who else could it be?

03:35.120 --> 03:37.670
Who ordered you to do this?

03:38.190 --> 03:39.470
Who do you think?

03:39.870 --> 03:41.150
I'm asking you!

03:44.870 --> 03:45.700
Rong,

03:45.880 --> 03:48.160
I didn't dare to touch any of your money.

03:51.840 --> 03:52.300
It's...

03:53.680 --> 03:54.190
It's...

03:56.590 --> 03:57.050
It's...

03:58.230 --> 03:59.380
Louder!

04:00.120 --> 04:00.690
Mr. Zhou!

04:00.910 --> 04:01.440
Mr. Zhou!

04:01.800 --> 04:02.700
Catch him!

04:03.080 --> 04:03.610
Mr. Zhou!

04:03.840 --> 04:04.370
Mr. Zhou!

04:07.710 --> 04:08.370
Don't move.

04:10.430 --> 04:11.190
You too.

04:27.410 --> 04:28.140
Hurry up.

04:29.430 --> 04:30.560
Hello, Chief Zhang.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.580
When will you arrive?

04:31.580 --> 04:32.460
Almost there.

04:33.630 --> 04:34.750
Come on. Push harder. Come on!

04:34.750 --> 04:35.159
Hurry!

04:36.390 --> 04:37.120
Push harder!

04:37.750 --> 04:38.860
Who drove?

04:44.630 --> 04:45.640
Young man.

04:46.510 --> 04:47.310
We meet again.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.980
If you dare to shoot, I'll kill him.

04:53.070 --> 04:54.090
Young man,

04:54.800 --> 04:55.760
what do you want?

04:56.120 --> 04:57.310
Let my bro go.

04:58.070 --> 04:58.680
Give me

04:58.680 --> 05:00.280
the 1.5 million in your house

05:00.750 --> 05:02.480
and I'll return you your phone.

05:04.160 --> 05:05.020
Otherwise...

05:16.370 --> 05:17.320
Scared now?

05:21.040 --> 05:21.440
Chief.

05:21.490 --> 05:22.550
Was that a gunshot?

05:37.400 --> 05:38.400
Where is my phone?

05:57.950 --> 05:58.430
Rong.

05:58.870 --> 06:00.070
I'll go tend my wound.

06:06.480 --> 06:07.190
Rong, the...

06:07.190 --> 06:07.830
Police!

06:09.310 --> 06:10.240
Put the gun down!

06:10.240 --> 06:10.770
Back off!

06:12.070 --> 06:12.830
Put the gun down.

06:12.830 --> 06:13.690
You put it down.

06:13.750 --> 06:14.680
Put it down.

06:15.360 --> 06:16.560
Put it down.

06:16.720 --> 06:17.610
Put it down!

06:18.000 --> 06:18.660
Put it down.

06:19.310 --> 06:20.630
Put it down, please.

06:22.720 --> 06:23.380
Put it down.

06:29.680 --> 06:30.680
Stop pretending.

06:31.270 --> 06:31.870
Everyone,

06:32.390 --> 06:33.580
your boss is here.

06:34.040 --> 06:35.390
The mastermind behind the whole conspiracy—

06:35.390 --> 06:37.250
what are you looking at? It's you.

06:40.390 --> 06:41.360
Whose boss is he?

06:42.870 --> 06:43.800
My boss.

06:43.800 --> 06:45.300
Our boss.

06:49.870 --> 06:51.040
How did you know?

06:52.720 --> 06:53.900
When Lu Zheng died,

06:54.000 --> 06:55.680
you were at Sanjiangkou, right?

06:55.680 --> 06:57.340
You must've heard something.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.390
You came here

06:58.390 --> 06:59.600
on an irregular transfer.

06:59.600 --> 07:01.070
You kept a
close eye on me
since you arrived here.

07:01.070 --> 07:02.600
I told you the report letter was fake;

07:02.600 --> 07:03.830
why are you still after me?

07:03.830 --> 07:04.850
Did I offend you?

07:08.950 --> 07:09.800
I smashed

07:10.390 --> 07:11.820
this phone myself!

07:12.070 --> 07:13.600
Why did it suddenly appear?

07:13.800 --> 07:15.630
Who has such technical support?

07:17.000 --> 07:18.120
Putting an undercover

07:18.120 --> 07:19.660
like him by my side—

07:19.920 --> 07:21.720
who could be so good at scheming?

07:22.430 --> 07:24.000
You had him and Ms. Li

07:24.040 --> 07:25.510
create a fake car accident.

07:25.510 --> 07:28.570
Who can get the support
of the traffic police like this?

07:28.800 --> 07:30.950
You had him introduce Ms. Li to me.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.000
Yet she had to appear

07:32.000 --> 07:33.750
on the day I was making my deals.

07:34.870 --> 07:35.360
Rong.

07:37.670 --> 07:38.920
If she hadn't covered them,

07:38.920 --> 07:41.120
these two idiots
wouldn't have stolen from me.

07:41.120 --> 07:42.380
With just the two of us.

07:43.630 --> 07:44.830
We can steal from you.

07:47.390 --> 07:48.070
Your triad

07:48.560 --> 07:49.390
has reunited here

07:49.390 --> 07:50.430
now.

07:50.870 --> 07:52.670
Shouldn't you, the mastermind,

07:52.830 --> 07:54.600
appear now too?

07:59.390 --> 08:00.310
Well...

08:01.070 --> 08:02.330
Your analysis is good.

08:02.390 --> 08:02.830
Stop.

08:04.510 --> 08:05.640
If my guess is right,

08:06.160 --> 08:06.800
Zhu Yifei

08:07.310 --> 08:09.240
is someone on your side too, right?

08:10.070 --> 08:11.090
Well...

08:11.360 --> 08:11.920
How did you

08:11.920 --> 08:13.240
find out about that?

08:13.430 --> 08:14.560
We are not under him.

08:14.630 --> 08:15.510
Yes, yes, we are!

08:15.510 --> 08:16.290
Shut up!

08:18.310 --> 08:19.040
Chief Zhang,

08:20.040 --> 08:21.700
let me ask you a few questions.

08:21.720 --> 08:22.510
Explain it properly

08:22.510 --> 08:24.170
and we can talk about the rest.

08:24.800 --> 08:25.240
Sure.

08:25.480 --> 08:26.010
Go ahead.

08:26.360 --> 08:27.070
What's with

08:27.560 --> 08:28.270
the phone?

08:29.320 --> 08:34.809
♪ Doubt ♪

08:31.630 --> 08:33.320
It's easy for the police

08:33.320 --> 08:34.179
to find a phone.

08:34.320 --> 08:35.919
What about the video inside?

08:36.549 --> 08:37.390
That's nothing difficult

08:37.200 --> 08:42.539
♪ Doubt ♪

08:37.390 --> 08:38.270
for the police,

08:38.270 --> 08:39.030
right?

08:41.000 --> 08:42.750
You had me deal with Zhu Yifei,

08:42.870 --> 08:44.670
but called it off suddenly—why?

08:45.750 --> 09:00.400
♪ Doubt, doubt the doubt ♪

08:49.000 --> 08:50.260
You know why yourself!

08:51.000 --> 08:51.720
Say it!

08:56.200 --> 08:57.930
You did it for the East New Town?

09:01.200 --> 09:02.260
East New Town, yes.

09:03.390 --> 09:04.790
Fang Yong said
he wanted to give it to someone else—

09:04.790 --> 09:06.200
he was referring to you, right?

09:06.200 --> 09:06.800
Fang Yong?

09:07.910 --> 09:08.390
Yes!

09:11.270 --> 09:13.360
I've been building an empire here
for half my life

09:13.360 --> 09:14.030
and here you are, ruining it

09:14.030 --> 09:15.760
just a few days after arriving!

09:16.270 --> 09:17.510
Zhang Yi'ang, I...

09:19.670 --> 09:20.740
♪ He is ♪

09:20.640 --> 09:22.180
Mr. Zhou, aim properly!

09:22.320 --> 09:24.690
♪ Too cunning but like a joke ♪

09:22.670 --> 09:23.550
Mr. Zhou!

09:24.000 --> 09:24.530
Mr. Zhou!

09:24.910 --> 09:25.910
I can only repay your teachings

09:25.910 --> 09:27.690
with my death!

09:26.110 --> 09:27.210
♪ Ha ha ha ♪

09:28.680 --> 09:29.890
♪ He ♪

09:28.910 --> 09:29.720
Li Qian!

09:40.550 --> 09:41.000
I...

09:41.030 --> 09:41.440
Chief!

09:41.480 --> 09:42.140
I didn't...

09:43.150 --> 09:44.270
Sit down.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.000
I'll be fine
after laying down for a while.

09:52.000 --> 09:52.730
I'll be fine.

09:52.920 --> 09:53.490
Chief.

09:53.720 --> 09:54.780
Call an ambulance.

09:55.080 --> 09:55.540
It's...

09:56.390 --> 09:57.390
quite cold.

10:00.150 --> 10:00.670
Chief.

10:01.550 --> 10:02.000
Chief?

10:02.240 --> 10:02.720
Chief.

10:03.320 --> 10:04.030
Hang in there.

10:04.030 --> 10:05.480
We're almost at the hospital.

10:05.480 --> 10:06.240
Don't sleep.

10:06.750 --> 10:07.880
Chief, don't sleep.

10:07.890 --> 10:08.590
[Human Organs]

10:07.960 --> 10:08.620
Don't sleep!

10:08.620 --> 10:10.400
[Lung] [Heart] [Stomach]
[Pancreas] [Kidney] [Appendicitis]

10:09.390 --> 10:10.390
Don't sleep!

10:13.320 --> 10:14.120
Captain Wang.

10:15.550 --> 10:17.010
Where Chief Zhang's shot—

10:17.030 --> 10:18.390
that's a dangerous spot.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.510
Screw off.

10:22.360 --> 10:23.090
Chief Zhang.

10:24.960 --> 10:25.820
Is there anyone

10:26.080 --> 10:27.720
we need to notify in your family?

10:27.720 --> 10:28.390
No.

10:32.200 --> 10:33.200
It's not that serious.

10:33.200 --> 10:34.510
It's just a reflected bullet.

10:34.510 --> 10:34.870
Wang,

10:34.870 --> 10:36.320
you're making me nervous.

10:36.320 --> 10:36.920
You lot...

10:38.240 --> 10:39.440
Is there enough time?

10:40.480 --> 10:41.940
Enough time for a meeting.

10:42.480 --> 10:43.610
I'm afraid it's not.

10:45.870 --> 10:46.480
Doctor,

10:46.910 --> 10:48.440
please think of a way, okay?

10:48.750 --> 10:50.420
I don't think I'll die yet.

10:50.760 --> 10:52.560
Who told you you're going to die?

10:52.560 --> 10:54.020
Don't hide it from him now.

10:54.030 --> 10:54.630
He was shot

10:54.630 --> 10:56.290
at where his vital organs are.

10:56.390 --> 10:57.390
Who told you that?

10:57.390 --> 10:58.280
You did.

10:58.480 --> 10:59.630
You said he wouldn't have time
for a meeting—

10:59.630 --> 11:00.760
what does that mean?

11:02.270 --> 11:03.460
We're dating.

11:03.670 --> 11:05.030
We had plans for our parents to meet
this afternoon.

11:05.030 --> 11:06.670
But now that we're out on an emergency,

11:06.670 --> 11:07.730
we will be delayed.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.720
A life is at stake here,

11:10.720 --> 11:11.330
okay?

11:11.360 --> 11:12.030
You are doctors.

11:12.030 --> 11:13.440
You have to be careful with your words.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.240
The patient's condition is very stable.

11:15.240 --> 11:15.550
Yes.

11:15.550 --> 11:16.800
Ar-Ae you sure?

11:16.960 --> 11:18.910
Are you the doctor or am I the doctor?

11:18.910 --> 11:20.030
Once he gets the bullet out of him
when he arrives at the hospital,

11:20.030 --> 11:20.870
we can get down from the bed in 1 day

11:20.870 --> 11:21.960
and be discharged in 3 days.

11:21.960 --> 11:22.550
You two,

11:22.600 --> 11:24.150
if you keep scaring him, get off.

11:24.150 --> 11:24.670
You...

11:24.670 --> 11:25.470
Captain Wang.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.040
Thank you.

11:27.630 --> 11:28.350
Thank you.

11:28.790 --> 11:30.000
Sorry about that.

11:30.630 --> 11:31.230
It's okay.

11:31.270 --> 11:32.500
Put your phone away.

11:32.630 --> 11:33.030
Okay.

11:36.960 --> 11:38.420
You're fine. Don't worry.

11:41.960 --> 11:44.330
[Ambulance]

11:44.760 --> 11:51.030
[Emergency]

11:54.200 --> 11:56.000
Come, give me a hand. Be careful.

12:00.410 --> 12:01.010
Wait.

12:01.080 --> 12:01.510
Wait.

12:01.600 --> 12:02.300
Stop, stop.

12:06.390 --> 12:07.280
What happened?

12:07.440 --> 12:08.600
We didn't catch Huo Zheng.

12:08.600 --> 12:09.960
He has been with Zhu Yifei for many years

12:09.960 --> 12:10.670
and their relationship runs deep.

12:10.670 --> 12:11.670
I'm afraid he'll take revenge on you.

12:11.670 --> 12:12.600
I've increased
the security of the hospital.

12:12.600 --> 12:13.770
Revenge?

12:14.000 --> 12:14.790
Zhu Yifei fell off

12:14.790 --> 12:15.360
the cliff himself.

12:15.360 --> 12:16.120
I didn't push him.

12:16.120 --> 12:16.790
Revenge...

12:17.440 --> 12:18.640
Take the people away.

12:18.790 --> 12:19.790
Go find Huo Zheng.

12:20.550 --> 12:21.950
Are you two done talking?

12:22.390 --> 12:23.000
What if?

12:23.000 --> 12:23.780
What if what?

12:24.670 --> 12:25.400
I'm a police.

12:26.030 --> 12:27.230
I'm not afraid of him.

12:27.720 --> 12:28.390
Let him come.

12:28.390 --> 12:29.150
Even on the surgical bed,

12:29.150 --> 12:30.270
I can handle him with one hand.

12:30.270 --> 12:30.910
-All right, all right.
-Let's go.

12:30.910 --> 12:31.320
-Let's go.
-Come on.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.000
Listen to me.

12:32.000 --> 12:32.430
Slowly.

12:32.430 --> 12:33.030
Lift it up.

12:33.120 --> 12:33.600
Slowly!

12:33.600 --> 12:34.120
Be careful!

12:34.120 --> 12:34.580
Slowly.

12:38.100 --> 12:38.740
Go find Huo Zheng.

12:38.740 --> 12:39.280
Yes!

12:39.720 --> 12:41.000
Team 1 and Team 2, get in!

12:40.410 --> 12:44.170
[Emergency]

12:49.540 --> 12:51.200
The police arrested someone.

12:52.030 --> 12:53.260
That cultural dealer

12:53.320 --> 12:55.290
drove off the cliff and died.

12:55.390 --> 12:58.790
I heard the leader
was Chief Zhang from the Municipal Bureau.

13:01.390 --> 13:01.840
Uncle.

13:04.620 --> 13:06.190
I will get your revenge.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.000
What's going on?

13:16.000 --> 13:16.930
What's going on?

13:26.960 --> 13:27.630
Raise your arms.

13:27.630 --> 13:28.360
Turn around.

13:29.000 --> 13:29.930
Raise your arms.

13:33.790 --> 13:34.200
Go.

13:34.270 --> 13:35.000
Turn around.

13:36.630 --> 13:37.120
Next.

13:39.200 --> 13:39.600
Here.

13:44.510 --> 13:45.570
Turn around. Next.

13:47.750 --> 13:48.390
Here. Go.

13:54.120 --> 13:54.920
Open your bag.

13:55.000 --> 13:55.510
Next.

13:55.550 --> 13:56.160
Go.

13:56.240 --> 13:56.630
Hey.

13:56.790 --> 13:57.720
Why are you cutting the queue?

13:57.720 --> 13:58.250
Exactly.

13:58.990 --> 13:59.920
Raise your arms.

14:03.150 --> 14:03.810
Okay. Next.

14:05.550 --> 14:06.390
Hurry up.

14:06.960 --> 14:08.000
Raise your arms.

14:08.550 --> 14:09.270
I've been

14:09.270 --> 14:10.870
coughing for a week.

14:11.510 --> 14:12.240
Turn around.

14:13.320 --> 14:14.670
Is it pneumonia?

14:14.720 --> 14:16.180
Go see the doctor quickly.

14:19.840 --> 14:20.440
Next.

14:26.550 --> 14:27.480
Raise your arms.

14:27.790 --> 14:28.790
Whose bag is this?

14:29.360 --> 14:30.200
Mine.

14:31.390 --> 14:32.190
What's wrong?

14:32.270 --> 14:33.320
What happened?

14:33.750 --> 14:34.910
What about this knife?

14:34.910 --> 14:36.440
That's not mine.

14:36.510 --> 14:38.000
I didn't put this in.

14:38.270 --> 14:39.150
Tell the truth.

14:39.240 --> 14:39.770
Hey.

14:39.870 --> 14:41.200
Look at the state I'm in.

14:41.200 --> 14:42.270
Why should I carry a knife?

14:42.270 --> 14:43.200
I'm calling the police.

14:43.200 --> 14:44.510
Don't, I have an exam this afternoon.

14:44.510 --> 14:45.310
Take him away.

14:45.320 --> 14:45.630
Hey!

14:45.720 --> 14:46.440
What are you doing?

14:46.440 --> 14:47.360
I really have an exam this afternoon.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.270
I'll be late!

15:01.290 --> 15:02.310
[4th floor]

15:02.310 --> 15:03.670
[Surgery Room]

15:22.600 --> 15:23.660
Don't be nervous.

15:24.150 --> 15:25.080
I'm not nervous.

15:30.480 --> 15:32.550
Starting now, count to 10.

15:33.390 --> 15:34.190
When?

15:34.320 --> 15:35.270
Now.

15:37.390 --> 15:38.470
One....

15:42.750 --> 15:43.480
That's fast.

15:44.030 --> 15:45.270
That was a normal dosage.

15:45.270 --> 15:45.960
Okay.

15:53.030 --> 15:54.080
Where's this from?

15:54.080 --> 15:54.960
Someone tried to bring

15:54.960 --> 15:55.870
a knife in at the security check.

15:55.870 --> 15:56.750
They stopped him.

15:56.750 --> 15:57.460
Huo Zheng?

15:57.840 --> 15:58.320
No.

15:58.390 --> 15:59.750
Someone's trying to cause trouble?

15:59.750 --> 16:01.610
He insisted the knife wasn't his.

16:01.670 --> 16:02.200
If not his,

16:02.200 --> 16:03.800
did someone put it in his bag?

16:04.510 --> 16:05.030
Could it be

16:05.030 --> 16:06.360
Huo Zheng has sneaked in

16:06.910 --> 16:08.510
and is trying to distract us?

16:10.000 --> 16:10.460
Li Qian.

16:10.550 --> 16:11.320
You two stay here.

16:11.320 --> 16:11.630
Okay.

16:11.630 --> 16:12.360
Get the SWAT back.

16:12.360 --> 16:12.600
Yes.

16:12.600 --> 16:13.840
The rest of you, follow me.

16:13.840 --> 16:14.970
No matter what it is,

16:15.000 --> 16:16.460
don't let your guard down.

16:31.550 --> 16:32.060
Hurry!

16:42.340 --> 16:44.390
[Infusion Room]

16:45.240 --> 16:46.240
Check over there.

16:46.270 --> 16:46.750
Follow me.

16:46.750 --> 16:47.150
Okay.

16:49.290 --> 16:53.550
[Please keep quiet]

16:54.200 --> 16:54.910
You go this way.

16:54.910 --> 16:55.460
Okay.

16:56.400 --> 17:02.160
[Please keep quiet] [Infusion Room]

17:05.109 --> 17:08.760
[Please keep quiet] [Infusion Room]

17:14.720 --> 17:16.920
Hou Shengjie's skin test result is out.

17:26.400 --> 17:27.530
I'll be right there.

17:45.650 --> 17:47.880
[Infusion Room]

18:08.030 --> 18:09.230
Hou Shengjie, right?

18:11.160 --> 18:12.070
You're not allergic to penicillin,

18:12.070 --> 18:12.530
are you?

18:12.590 --> 18:13.070
I am.

18:14.510 --> 18:15.510
The test result shows

18:15.510 --> 18:17.200
you're not allergic to penicillin.

18:17.200 --> 18:18.530
Are you allergic or not?

18:19.960 --> 18:20.640
No.

18:24.910 --> 18:25.970
I'll verify again.

18:26.440 --> 18:27.200
Hou Shengjie,

18:27.200 --> 18:29.800
you're not not allergic to penicillin,
right?

18:41.880 --> 18:42.540
Don't move.

18:44.790 --> 18:45.590
Stop looking.

18:45.750 --> 18:46.810
Go keep an eye on the surgery room.

18:46.810 --> 18:47.810
Wait for the SWAT.

18:55.310 --> 18:55.760
Done.

19:19.200 --> 19:19.810
What?

19:32.640 --> 19:33.480
The SWAT is here.

19:33.480 --> 19:35.410
They're searching them one by one.

19:35.510 --> 19:36.590
Don't make too much noise.

19:36.590 --> 19:38.050
Don't scare the patients.

19:53.550 --> 19:55.020
One, two, three.

20:07.700 --> 20:12.930
[Surgery Room]

20:11.880 --> 20:12.270
Doctor!

20:12.270 --> 20:12.730
Doctor!

20:13.030 --> 20:13.560
How is it?

20:13.590 --> 20:14.680
The surgery went well.

20:14.250 --> 20:15.270
[Entrance Access Card]

20:14.720 --> 20:15.400
Don't worry.

20:15.400 --> 20:16.160
Just treat it

20:16.160 --> 20:17.310
as an ordinary appendicitis surgery.

20:17.310 --> 20:18.490
But it's not a minor trauma.

20:18.490 --> 20:19.510
So Chief Zhang's all right?

20:19.510 --> 20:19.960
He's fine.

20:19.960 --> 20:20.750
He'll come out

20:20.750 --> 20:21.750
when the anesthesia wears off.

20:21.750 --> 20:22.550
Thank you.

20:22.550 --> 20:23.260
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

20:23.260 --> 20:24.590
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

20:26.240 --> 20:27.060
It's fine now.

20:29.830 --> 20:30.290
Well...

20:31.350 --> 20:33.010
We still can't go in, it seems.

20:58.110 --> 20:58.750
Two...

22:03.590 --> 22:04.390
Captain Wang!

22:04.920 --> 22:05.680
Captain Wang.

22:05.680 --> 22:07.350
A doctor was knocked out in the toilet.

22:07.350 --> 22:09.210
His surgical uniform was stolen.

22:11.880 --> 22:12.680
Open the door!

22:13.270 --> 22:14.070
Open the door!

22:30.750 --> 22:33.310
How did you... get in?

22:35.750 --> 22:36.400
What are you doing?

22:36.400 --> 22:37.330
This is the surgery room.

22:37.330 --> 22:38.590
Where is Zhang Yi'ang?

22:38.920 --> 22:40.050
Tell me, where is he?

22:48.830 --> 22:49.620
I...

22:50.030 --> 22:50.960
will kill you...

22:52.190 --> 22:55.070
to avenge... avenge...

22:55.160 --> 22:56.700
Uncle Yifei.

23:01.030 --> 23:02.830
You scoundrel.

23:05.640 --> 23:07.490
Try it if you dare.

23:07.550 --> 23:10.590
Don't try me.

23:11.570 --> 23:15.920
♪ Throw a toy to
that bunch of brokers in town ♪

23:11.680 --> 23:12.480
I...

23:13.110 --> 23:15.000
will do it...

23:19.500 --> 23:22.100
♪ There's a strange, hazy feeling ♪

23:23.480 --> 23:25.060
♪ Waiting for me to make sense of it ♪

23:25.570 --> 23:27.850
♪ Worshippers hiding in the smoke,
just beyond reach ♪

23:30.130 --> 23:31.810
♪ They are all guests ♪

23:34.750 --> 23:36.400
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

23:41.830 --> 23:42.270
You...

23:43.070 --> 23:44.490
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

23:47.450 --> 23:49.100
♪ Be patient and wait ♪

23:53.200 --> 23:55.400
You really dealt with him with one hand.

24:13.750 --> 24:14.810
Comrade Fang Yong,

24:14.850 --> 24:16.050
there are some things

24:16.160 --> 24:17.100
we have to ask.

24:17.440 --> 24:19.250
Please come with us.

24:24.590 --> 24:25.170
Okay.

24:30.200 --> 24:30.810
How is it?

24:34.270 --> 24:35.210
Tell me.

24:38.310 --> 24:39.820
Good news and bad news—

24:40.240 --> 24:41.900
what do you want to hear first?

24:46.270 --> 24:47.800
The phone has been cracked.

24:48.510 --> 24:49.070
In one of

24:49.070 --> 24:50.530
Lang Bowen's past phones,

24:50.720 --> 24:52.160
there is a video Lang Bowen filmed

24:52.160 --> 24:53.760
during Chief Lu's accident.

24:54.720 --> 24:56.030
That video proved that

24:56.350 --> 24:57.950
Lang Bowen is just a witness.

24:57.960 --> 25:00.420
He can't be the murderer
who killed Chief Lu.

25:03.200 --> 25:04.920
Is this the good news or bad news?

25:04.920 --> 25:05.830
The bad news.

25:06.590 --> 25:07.990
What about the good news?

25:08.160 --> 25:09.690
The bad news is not over yet.

25:10.350 --> 25:10.960
Tell me.

25:11.720 --> 25:13.270
What were you going to do today?

25:13.270 --> 25:15.260
Rong said he couldn't leave today.

25:15.510 --> 25:17.310
He asked me to make a deal for him.

25:17.590 --> 25:19.450
It was all arranged by Hu Jianren.

25:19.830 --> 25:21.240
I don't know anything else.

25:21.240 --> 25:21.840
What deal?

25:22.480 --> 25:23.210
I don't know.

25:24.030 --> 25:25.430
I'm Mr. Zhou's employee.

25:25.920 --> 25:27.520
I went because he asked me to.

25:28.680 --> 25:30.270
You didn't ask what for?

25:30.350 --> 25:31.350
I ask Zhou Rong?

25:32.790 --> 25:33.550
He wouldn't

25:33.550 --> 25:35.210
have me do something illegal.

25:35.400 --> 25:37.350
I didn't do something illegal either.

25:37.350 --> 25:38.070
I don't know

25:38.070 --> 25:39.280
why I was arrested.

25:39.510 --> 25:40.640
You really don't know?

25:40.640 --> 25:41.160
I don't.

25:41.640 --> 25:42.350
I've always been

25:42.350 --> 25:43.510
an upright person.

25:43.640 --> 25:45.440
I will never accept your insult.

25:45.440 --> 25:46.640
Watch your attitude.

25:46.720 --> 25:48.010
Kill me!

25:48.510 --> 25:49.910
Still refusing to speak?

25:51.750 --> 25:52.680
I'm itchy.

25:52.830 --> 25:53.880
I'm itching.

25:54.480 --> 25:55.400
Just kill me—

25:55.750 --> 25:57.000
I will feel better!

25:58.110 --> 25:59.280
Did you give him allergy injection?

25:59.280 --> 25:59.990
Yes.

26:00.350 --> 26:00.960
But the doctor said

26:00.960 --> 26:02.110
it would take at least half an hour.

26:02.110 --> 26:03.310
Let me scratch!

26:03.310 --> 26:05.370
Stop flailing around. You won't die.

26:05.440 --> 26:06.240
Let me ask you.

26:06.880 --> 26:08.150
What's going on

26:08.310 --> 26:10.440
between Zhu Yifei, Zhou Rong, and you?

26:10.960 --> 26:13.440
I want to see Zhang Yi'ang.

26:13.880 --> 26:15.140
I'll only speak to him.

26:15.880 --> 26:17.240
Answer whatever's asked!

26:17.240 --> 26:18.920
This is not the place for you
to raise requests!

26:18.920 --> 26:20.310
Tell me about the night

26:20.310 --> 26:21.600
Ye Jian was killed.

26:22.200 --> 26:23.760
I've told you everything.

26:24.160 --> 26:25.480
I really don't know.

26:25.640 --> 26:26.370
Lu Yibo.

26:26.880 --> 26:28.000
Look at the situation you're in.

26:28.000 --> 26:28.590
Still not talking?

26:28.590 --> 26:29.590
If you don't believe me,

26:29.590 --> 26:31.390
there's nothing I can do either.

26:31.750 --> 26:32.700
What Xiaofei?

26:32.790 --> 26:33.550
I don't know him.

26:33.550 --> 26:35.160
Someone saw you together.

26:36.590 --> 26:37.790
Do you have evidence?

26:37.880 --> 26:38.940
You want evidence?

26:42.750 --> 26:43.610
Half a year ago,

26:43.790 --> 26:45.330
a car accident

26:45.400 --> 26:47.200
at a Sanjiangkou intersection.

26:47.200 --> 26:47.790
The victim is

26:47.790 --> 26:49.440
Deputy Chief of
the Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau,

26:49.440 --> 26:50.080
Lu Zheng.

26:50.480 --> 26:51.480
Your phone

26:51.510 --> 26:52.640
filmed

26:52.640 --> 26:53.840
the whole accident.

26:54.550 --> 26:55.480
You don't remember?

26:55.480 --> 26:57.550
Three days after Chief Lu's accident,

26:57.550 --> 26:59.640
Rong Cheng transferred 30 million yuan

26:59.640 --> 27:01.340
project fee to Otto.

27:01.590 --> 27:02.160
Slander.

27:03.200 --> 27:04.730
This is a complete slander.

27:05.790 --> 27:07.440
You can check my bank.

27:08.030 --> 27:08.920
See how much money

27:08.920 --> 27:10.050
I have on my account.

27:10.200 --> 27:12.000
It's meaningless to waste time.

27:12.000 --> 27:13.260
Answer the questions.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.100
I want to see...
[Yi'ang.]

27:21.880 --> 27:23.350
That's a long bad news.

27:24.480 --> 27:25.790
What about the good news?

27:25.790 --> 27:27.920
Luckily there's Fang Chao and Liu Zhi.

27:28.030 --> 27:30.960
We were the perpetrators
of the provincial capital explosion case.

27:30.960 --> 27:31.690
It wasn't us.

27:31.880 --> 27:33.650
We also robbed the Land Rover.

27:33.720 --> 27:34.680
We both don't know how to drive.

27:34.680 --> 27:35.680
Why should we steal his car?

27:35.680 --> 27:36.720
I subdued that dude

27:36.720 --> 27:37.400
immediately.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.550
Don't believe that bastard.

27:38.550 --> 27:39.590
Nothing he says is true.

27:39.590 --> 27:40.890
But, just one thing—

27:41.110 --> 27:42.480
we didn't kill that dude

27:42.480 --> 27:43.880
who drove the Land Rover.

27:44.200 --> 27:45.440
My bro

27:46.200 --> 27:47.660
has never lied in his life.

27:49.590 --> 27:50.550
He did

27:50.550 --> 27:51.880
choked to his own death.

27:52.640 --> 27:54.850
The phone deal with Zhou Rong this time—

27:54.960 --> 27:57.330
my brother lured him away

27:57.510 --> 27:59.120
to have him get 20 million.

27:59.310 --> 28:01.210
Then he changed it to 5 million.

28:01.310 --> 28:03.270
At the end he charged
straight to his house

28:03.270 --> 28:05.250
to get 15 million.

28:06.030 --> 28:06.690
What a pity.

28:07.400 --> 28:08.730
With your bro's IQ,

28:08.790 --> 28:10.450
he can't make up such nosense.

28:10.720 --> 28:11.580
You were the one

28:11.750 --> 28:13.610
who came up with the ideas, right?

28:16.070 --> 28:16.640
Officer.

28:17.160 --> 28:17.880
Well...

28:19.830 --> 28:22.790
Can I get a reduced sentence
for reporting a corrupt official?

28:22.790 --> 28:24.310
That's Yu Yueran's calligraphy—

28:24.310 --> 28:25.570
how much's that worth?

28:26.030 --> 28:26.680
It's fake.

28:28.110 --> 28:29.470
Is this fake too?

28:36.110 --> 28:37.000
A Yuan Qinghua.

28:37.880 --> 28:39.880
Tripod cauldron with Chih-dragon handles.

28:39.880 --> 28:40.750
How much is it?

28:42.000 --> 28:43.060
This painting too.

28:43.310 --> 28:45.240
It's from when Qi Baishi was young.

28:45.720 --> 28:46.980
How much would that be?

28:47.720 --> 28:49.680
And the bed next door—

28:50.640 --> 28:52.100
do you dare to sleep on it?

28:57.000 --> 28:58.200
Fang Yong told Zhou Rong

28:58.200 --> 28:58.920
to trade for the East New Town project

28:58.920 --> 29:00.360
with bianzhong.

29:05.510 --> 29:06.380
Good.

29:06.830 --> 29:07.430
Very good.

29:07.680 --> 29:09.740
It'll be easier with this statement.

29:10.070 --> 29:10.600
Zhang,

29:10.720 --> 29:11.550
why did get down...

29:11.550 --> 29:12.420
I-I'm fine.

29:13.010 --> 29:13.880
Hearing good news,

29:13.880 --> 29:16.210
the wound doesn't hurt that much anymore.

29:23.680 --> 29:25.210
Don't be too old fashioned.

29:27.570 --> 29:28.630
Moving around more

29:29.030 --> 29:31.050
is the best way to recover.

29:31.720 --> 29:32.510
Look.

29:32.960 --> 29:34.560
I'm walking.

29:34.590 --> 29:36.160
Look at me.

29:36.680 --> 29:37.140
Look...

29:38.160 --> 29:38.890
Chief Zhang.

29:39.310 --> 29:40.610
It's nothing.

29:40.720 --> 29:41.950
It's okay.

29:42.030 --> 29:42.850
Turn around.

29:43.070 --> 29:44.000
Let's go another round.

29:44.000 --> 29:44.590
That's enough.

29:44.590 --> 29:45.200
I can do it!

29:45.270 --> 29:45.720
Come.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.170
Turn around.

29:53.480 --> 29:54.650
Slowly.

29:56.750 --> 29:57.490
Yi'ang.

29:58.310 --> 29:59.170
-Who—
-Yi'ang!

29:59.440 --> 30:00.060
Chief Qi.

30:00.110 --> 30:00.690
Wh-Why

30:00.720 --> 30:02.070
are you already walking?

30:02.070 --> 30:02.640
Here, here.

30:02.640 --> 30:03.900
I need to get used to it.

30:04.000 --> 30:05.080
You're being ridiculous.

30:05.080 --> 30:05.990
Seriously.

30:06.200 --> 30:07.510
Lie down.

30:07.510 --> 30:08.240
I'm fine. Seriously.

30:08.240 --> 30:08.680
Move.

30:08.880 --> 30:09.550
Lie down.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.160
Here.

30:10.400 --> 30:10.960
Be careful.

30:10.960 --> 30:11.830
-I'm fine.
-Slowly.

30:11.830 --> 30:12.350
Slowly.

30:12.480 --> 30:13.140
Be careful.

30:13.400 --> 30:14.000
Slowly.

30:14.070 --> 30:15.240
Slowly.

30:17.880 --> 30:18.440
See.

30:18.790 --> 30:20.320
-It's okay. Come on.
-Here.

30:20.640 --> 30:21.170
Okay.

30:22.920 --> 30:24.320
He wouldn't listen to me.

30:24.960 --> 30:25.640
See?

30:27.350 --> 30:28.440
Sit, Chief Qi. Sit.

30:28.590 --> 30:29.920
Sit, Captain Wang. Sit.

30:30.400 --> 30:31.950
Take it easy.

30:35.270 --> 30:36.800
How was the interrogation?

30:39.750 --> 30:40.820
How did it go?

30:42.550 --> 30:43.190
Not good.

30:43.790 --> 30:44.390
Not good.?

30:44.400 --> 30:45.600
The others went fine,

30:45.680 --> 30:46.480
but Zhou Rong—

30:46.790 --> 30:48.110
every time we asked him something,

30:48.110 --> 30:49.170
he asked to see you.

30:49.270 --> 30:50.690
Zhou Rong still thinks

30:51.480 --> 30:53.170
you were trying try harm him.

30:53.640 --> 30:54.350
This should be

30:54.350 --> 30:55.610
why he wants to see you.

30:59.270 --> 31:00.330
I do want to see him.

31:02.640 --> 31:03.170
Let's go!

31:03.770 --> 31:04.440
Where are you going?

31:04.440 --> 31:05.110
I'm fine!

31:05.640 --> 31:06.480
Chief Qi said

31:06.480 --> 31:07.400
I can be discharged.

31:07.400 --> 31:08.330
Right, Chief Qi?

31:08.550 --> 31:10.210
Take me to the 4th floor first.

31:11.070 --> 31:16.220
♪ Doubt ♪

31:15.920 --> 31:16.480
Hu Jianren

31:16.480 --> 31:17.870
was sentenced to a year

31:17.920 --> 31:18.920
for assault.

31:19.070 --> 31:20.030
Zhou Rong went to Chief Lu

31:19.520 --> 31:24.940
♪ Doubt ♪

31:20.070 --> 31:21.440
to help ease this situation.

31:21.440 --> 31:23.480
But Chief Lu insists on his principles.

31:23.480 --> 31:24.340
We suspect that

31:24.440 --> 31:26.270
he held a grudge against Chief Lu,

31:26.270 --> 31:28.130
so he hired Lang Bowen to kill him.

31:29.110 --> 31:43.450
♪ Doubt, doubt the doubt ♪

31:29.880 --> 31:30.670
Also,

31:31.000 --> 31:32.440
why were two deals

31:32.550 --> 31:34.550
going on at the same time yesterday?

31:34.750 --> 31:36.350
Why didn't Zhou Rong show up?

31:37.460 --> 31:39.030
This is a mess.

31:40.270 --> 31:40.790
Yi'ang,

31:41.480 --> 31:43.280
do you think you can do anything?

31:44.070 --> 31:45.310
No matter how cunning a hunter is,

31:45.310 --> 31:46.770
they're no match for a fox.

31:52.780 --> 31:54.580
I think he got that saying wrong.

31:55.110 --> 31:56.190
Focus on the road.

32:10.440 --> 32:11.640
I'll leave the rest

32:11.960 --> 32:12.880
to you.

32:13.510 --> 32:14.750
Chief Qi, don't worry.

32:14.750 --> 32:15.550
Please go ahead.

32:15.550 --> 32:15.960
Okay.

32:16.070 --> 32:16.830
I'm heading back to my office first.

32:16.830 --> 32:17.200
Okay.

32:21.680 --> 32:22.410
Chief Zhang,

32:22.830 --> 32:24.890
you have a way to make Zhou Rong speak?

32:25.270 --> 32:26.860
I don't for now.

32:27.440 --> 32:28.350
But you just said—

32:28.350 --> 32:30.750
I can't say I have nothing for now
to my boss.

32:31.240 --> 32:31.900
Be careful.

32:33.640 --> 32:34.440
Captain Wang!

32:36.310 --> 32:37.640
Captain Wang, it's me!

32:45.720 --> 32:47.180
Where do you think this is?

32:47.480 --> 32:48.410
A bar?

32:48.790 --> 32:49.610
Take it back.

32:49.790 --> 32:50.590
Brother Wang,

32:51.000 --> 32:51.750
please help.

32:52.480 --> 32:53.590
Yibo can't sleep at night

32:53.590 --> 32:54.550
if he doesn't drink a little.

32:54.550 --> 32:57.010
He can fall asleep when
he has a peace of mind.

32:57.070 --> 32:57.510
Also,

32:57.510 --> 32:58.640
you can call me by my name—

32:58.640 --> 32:59.550
Captain Wang's good too.

32:59.550 --> 33:00.510
Don't call me Brother Wang.

33:00.510 --> 33:02.310
Where did the brother come from?

33:02.790 --> 33:04.990
You are not allowed to give gifts, okay?

33:05.110 --> 33:05.680
Got it.

33:08.510 --> 33:09.660
How is Yibo now?

33:09.960 --> 33:11.230
I can't tell you.

33:12.440 --> 33:13.240
Captain Wang.

33:13.590 --> 33:14.350
I know Yibo

33:14.350 --> 33:16.080
wouldn't dare to say anything.

33:16.550 --> 33:17.950
This is really not on him.

33:18.160 --> 33:19.560
He's afraid of Zhou Rong.

33:19.680 --> 33:21.280
It's useless to tell me this.

33:22.310 --> 33:23.310
We follow the law.

33:28.530 --> 33:32.130
[Sanjiangkou Public Security Bureau]

33:41.750 --> 33:42.880
Zhou Rong, come out.

33:50.030 --> 33:50.880
Chief Zhang

33:51.160 --> 33:52.760
is finally showing his face?

33:53.350 --> 33:54.280
How did you know?

34:06.480 --> 34:06.920
Weird.

34:07.830 --> 34:09.550
No one told him.

34:09.840 --> 34:10.940
How did he know

34:11.150 --> 34:12.760
that it's Chief Zhang interrogating him?

34:12.760 --> 34:13.290
Officer.

34:15.590 --> 34:16.750
Excuse me.

34:17.230 --> 34:19.159
What's the weather like tomorrow?

34:21.800 --> 34:22.530
Will it rain?

34:23.110 --> 34:24.510
Will the winds be strong?

34:24.550 --> 34:26.219
I left my laundry outside.

34:27.150 --> 34:28.230
Help me check it up.

34:38.320 --> 34:38.960
Help me

34:39.710 --> 34:40.840
remove this needle.

34:41.280 --> 34:42.150
Don't you have to go back to the hospital

34:42.150 --> 34:43.750
to get your injection later?

34:43.840 --> 34:45.310
I'd look weak like this.

34:46.030 --> 34:46.690
Pull it out.

34:49.590 --> 34:50.070
Take it.

34:51.800 --> 34:52.800
Two, one. Go.

35:00.030 --> 35:01.490
You're here, Chief Zhang.

35:02.000 --> 35:03.000
How is your injury?

35:03.000 --> 35:03.530
I'm fine.

35:04.030 --> 35:05.360
I just lost my appendix.

35:05.400 --> 35:06.150
You know I'm injured,

35:06.150 --> 35:07.630
yet you insisted on seeing me.

35:07.630 --> 35:08.710
I'm injured too.

35:08.710 --> 35:10.310
I wasn't allowed to lie down.

35:10.840 --> 35:11.920
Then let's quickly

35:12.030 --> 35:13.400
clear things up.

35:13.840 --> 35:15.830
I'll try my best

35:15.960 --> 35:16.840
to get you

35:16.840 --> 35:18.180
the best results.

35:18.670 --> 35:19.670
If we wrap this up quickly,
you can go to bed

35:19.670 --> 35:20.400
early.

35:20.510 --> 35:21.610
Think I'm a kid?

35:22.110 --> 35:22.630
Best

35:22.630 --> 35:23.630
results?

35:24.110 --> 35:25.510
Make two death penalties

35:25.510 --> 35:26.520
into one?

35:28.000 --> 35:29.860
Why are you so eager to see me then?

35:32.320 --> 35:32.960
Be honest.

35:34.110 --> 35:35.570
You planted so many people

35:35.670 --> 35:36.880
around me—

35:37.840 --> 35:39.260
what's your purpose?

35:40.030 --> 35:41.440
To obey the law.

35:42.000 --> 35:42.730
Drop the act!

35:43.440 --> 35:44.150
Sanjiangkou

35:44.150 --> 35:45.360
is all yours now, right?

35:45.360 --> 35:46.240
Your purpose is to

35:46.240 --> 35:47.240
end me.

35:47.480 --> 35:48.080
Zhou Rong.

35:48.150 --> 35:48.880
The interrogation room is not

35:48.880 --> 35:51.010
is not a place for you to talk nonsense.

35:51.190 --> 35:51.840
I'm sorry.

35:53.070 --> 35:53.880
I forgot...

35:54.800 --> 35:56.000
I forgot this is
the public security bureau.

35:56.000 --> 35:57.480
I can't talk like that, right?

35:57.480 --> 35:58.480
Understandable.

35:58.920 --> 36:00.400
The characteristics of his illness

36:00.400 --> 36:01.250
is

36:01.670 --> 36:02.410
suspicion

36:02.590 --> 36:03.990
and he easily gets angry.

36:04.710 --> 36:05.320
We can

36:05.320 --> 36:06.270
have a

36:06.360 --> 36:07.440
peaceful discussion

36:07.440 --> 36:08.190
as patients.

36:09.190 --> 36:09.710
Yes.

36:10.110 --> 36:11.370
We're in the same boat.

36:11.400 --> 36:11.960
Otherwise, why would our first meeting

36:11.960 --> 36:13.020
be in the hospital?

36:14.000 --> 36:14.410
No.

36:14.440 --> 36:16.100
Our illnesses are different—

36:16.230 --> 36:17.230
mine's an external one,

36:17.230 --> 36:18.760
and your is an internal one.

36:22.250 --> 36:22.990
Look.

36:23.510 --> 36:24.340
I got

36:24.380 --> 36:25.950
[Seek the truth; act according to the law]

36:24.800 --> 36:25.840
the psychiatrist on the 4th floor

36:25.840 --> 36:27.110
to prescribe this for you.

36:25.970 --> 36:27.910
[Be fair and civilized in law enforcement]

36:27.670 --> 36:28.710
This is the medicine your normally take

36:28.710 --> 36:30.370
to calm yourself down, right?

36:33.800 --> 36:35.440
Have you taken your medication today?

36:35.440 --> 36:35.920
Yes.

36:37.230 --> 36:39.230
Okay, let me help unravel it for you.

36:40.710 --> 36:42.240
In May the year before last,

36:42.900 --> 36:44.030
there was a fight

36:44.030 --> 36:45.060
in Fenglinwan.

36:50.000 --> 36:52.030
Hu Jianren was sentenced
to a year in prison

36:52.030 --> 36:53.590
for assault.

36:54.440 --> 36:55.070
This case

36:55.070 --> 36:56.530
was concluded by Chief Lu.

36:57.670 --> 36:58.570
Half a year ago,

36:58.840 --> 36:59.840
Chief Lu retired.

37:07.800 --> 37:09.460
The story of your destruction

37:09.480 --> 37:10.840
has then begun.

37:12.190 --> 37:13.230
Chief Lu

37:13.230 --> 37:14.480
has mentioned how unethical enterprises

37:14.480 --> 37:16.540
conspire with law enforcement staff

37:16.550 --> 37:18.330
to get benefits

37:18.440 --> 37:20.170
at various press conferences.

37:20.230 --> 37:22.030
Those were all about you, right?

37:23.550 --> 37:24.750
Why are you smirking?

37:24.960 --> 37:25.440
You...

37:26.360 --> 37:27.230
I understand.

37:28.440 --> 37:30.000
You left a mark
in the public security records—

37:30.000 --> 37:31.590
you were worried
that it'd affect your business.

37:31.590 --> 37:33.190
You were also worried that
you would lose your status

37:33.190 --> 37:34.030
in Sanjiangkou

37:34.030 --> 37:35.030
and you got angry.

37:35.110 --> 37:36.400
Did you make those threats

37:36.400 --> 37:37.230
because of these?

37:37.230 --> 37:38.200
Offering 30 million

37:38.200 --> 37:39.230
for Lu Zheng's life.

37:39.230 --> 37:39.830
Am I right?

37:40.480 --> 37:41.110
I killed him

37:41.110 --> 37:42.550
to avenge my brother.

37:43.400 --> 37:45.130
He locked Hu up for a whole year.

37:45.190 --> 37:46.630
I went to beg him myself.

37:46.670 --> 37:48.670
He didn't give me any respect at all.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.240
Chief Lu!

37:50.670 --> 37:51.600
Chief Lu.

37:51.840 --> 37:52.400
That must've been tiring.

37:52.400 --> 37:53.230
You had to climb so many steps—

37:53.230 --> 37:55.290
why didn't they install an elevator?

37:55.440 --> 37:57.360
I'm Zhou Rong from Rongcheng Real Estate.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.510
I wanted to look for you at your office,

37:58.510 --> 37:59.030
but...

37:59.070 --> 38:00.590
I was afraid it would bring bad influence
to your reputation.

38:00.590 --> 38:01.110
Right?

38:01.470 --> 38:02.330
So...

38:02.630 --> 38:04.630
Why does he have to give you respect?

38:05.960 --> 38:06.960
Locking Hu Jianren up

38:06.960 --> 38:07.970
is by the law.

38:09.230 --> 38:10.410
No one

38:10.550 --> 38:11.650
can change it.

38:13.150 --> 38:14.680
There was something worse.

38:14.800 --> 38:15.520
Lu,

38:15.800 --> 38:16.800
after you retire,

38:16.920 --> 38:17.840
who do you think

38:17.880 --> 38:19.240
should take over you?

38:19.760 --> 38:20.540
How is Ye?

38:29.630 --> 38:30.430
Lu Zheng

38:30.760 --> 38:32.290
hindered Ye Jian's future.

38:33.800 --> 38:35.400
Ye Jian was a good cop, right?

38:36.070 --> 38:37.400
He never took a penny from me.

38:37.400 --> 38:39.040
He never did anything for me.

38:39.070 --> 38:41.070
He was held back because of Lu Zheng!

38:42.070 --> 38:44.070
Ye Jian was indeed a good policeman.

38:44.630 --> 38:45.740
We all know that.

38:46.030 --> 38:46.960
But I want to know

38:47.480 --> 38:48.890
who told you

38:49.280 --> 38:50.880
Lu Zheng was against Ye Jian?

38:52.190 --> 38:53.360
He never once did.

38:55.110 --> 38:56.740
Cheif Qi told me about this.

38:57.960 --> 38:59.260
He is a talent.

38:59.710 --> 39:01.510
We should send him out to learn.

39:02.000 --> 39:03.360
It's a pity for him

39:03.880 --> 39:05.210
to stay in Sanjiangkou.

39:10.000 --> 39:11.070
You mean I...

39:11.230 --> 39:12.360
By killing Lu Zheng,

39:12.670 --> 39:14.570
I held Ye Jian back too?

39:15.920 --> 39:17.250
I didn't mean that. I...

39:18.250 --> 39:18.800
Lu Zheng's death

39:18.800 --> 39:20.260
has nothing to do with you.

39:21.190 --> 39:23.050
Lu Zheng's death was an accident.

39:24.760 --> 39:25.480
We didn't have any evidence

39:25.480 --> 39:26.710
at first.

39:27.000 --> 39:27.880
But this is interesting.

39:27.880 --> 39:29.280
We haven't done anything

39:29.400 --> 39:30.230
coming to Sanjiangkou—

39:30.230 --> 39:30.880
all we saw were you lot

39:30.880 --> 39:32.000
running up and down

39:32.000 --> 39:33.330
trying to cover the murder evidence.

39:33.330 --> 39:35.000
I-It was quite ridiculous.

39:36.590 --> 39:37.050
Well...

39:38.150 --> 39:38.440
Wait.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.630
Th-The evidence in the phone

39:39.630 --> 39:40.670
i-is fake?

39:44.480 --> 39:46.340
Lang Bowen w-was messing with me?

39:47.400 --> 39:48.550
Lang Bowen filmed the crime scene

39:48.550 --> 39:49.960
with his phone.

39:50.030 --> 39:51.070
But it was also a coincidence

39:51.070 --> 39:52.070
that he filmed it.

39:52.840 --> 39:54.590
All he did was bring this phone to you

39:54.590 --> 39:55.440
to cheat a huge sum of money

39:55.440 --> 39:55.970
from you.

40:05.760 --> 40:06.290
Then I...

40:06.960 --> 40:09.990
I wasted my time with those two idiots.

40:11.150 --> 40:12.360
I can also tell you

40:12.800 --> 40:14.400
Du Cong is not someone I planted.

40:14.400 --> 40:15.590
Neither is Fang Chao and Liu Zhi.

40:15.590 --> 40:16.550
I didn't arrange for Officer Li

40:16.550 --> 40:18.010
to go to your house either.

40:18.670 --> 40:19.150
W-Wait.

40:19.150 --> 40:20.920
That's not what you said yesterday.

40:20.920 --> 40:21.920
What should I believe,

40:21.920 --> 40:22.400
Zhang Yi'ang?

40:22.400 --> 40:23.000
I didn't do

40:23.000 --> 40:23.960
these things, then.

40:23.960 --> 40:25.090
I won't admit it now.

40:25.550 --> 40:27.480
You can believe whatever you want.

40:29.070 --> 40:30.320
If you didn't do these,

40:30.320 --> 40:31.230
then let's talk about

40:31.230 --> 40:32.630
what you've done before.

40:33.280 --> 40:34.940
Speculating cultural relics

40:35.150 --> 40:36.440
and illegal arms possession.

40:36.440 --> 40:38.000
In order to get the East New Town project,

40:38.000 --> 40:38.960
you bribed officials

40:38.960 --> 40:39.670
and assaulted the police.

40:39.670 --> 40:40.870
You did these, right?

40:41.510 --> 40:43.360
There's also Hu Jianren
trying to get kickbacks,

40:43.360 --> 40:45.150
Du Cong using the company car
for his own use,

40:45.150 --> 40:46.550
Lu Yibo reporting his private life
being a mess...

40:46.550 --> 40:48.150
All right, stop right there.

40:48.550 --> 40:49.230
They are ungrateful!

40:49.230 --> 40:51.230
Trying to get me from behind my back.

40:51.230 --> 40:52.690
No one is trying to get you.

40:54.320 --> 40:55.030
But you were

40:55.030 --> 40:56.830
indeed dragged down by someone.

40:57.960 --> 40:58.820
You, yourself.

41:06.510 --> 41:07.030
Chief.

41:07.960 --> 41:09.160
The rest will be easy.

41:09.510 --> 41:10.670
Interrogate them seperately.

41:10.670 --> 41:11.110
Okay.

41:11.660 --> 41:16.390
[Interrogation Rooms]

41:17.360 --> 41:17.920
Chief.

41:19.550 --> 41:20.120
I'm fine.

41:21.030 --> 41:21.560
I'm fine.

41:23.400 --> 41:24.200
Captain Wang!

41:24.480 --> 41:25.810
Zhou Qi wants to see you.

41:25.840 --> 41:27.040
Why is she still here?

41:27.840 --> 41:28.320
I'll go take a look.

41:28.320 --> 41:28.710
Okay.

41:35.810 --> 41:36.540
Chief Zhang,

41:36.960 --> 41:38.550
don't make it difficult for me.

41:38.550 --> 41:40.210
I really don't know anything.

41:42.590 --> 41:44.390
Because you reported Zhou Rong,

41:45.000 --> 41:46.930
yet Zhou Rong chose to forgive you,

41:47.840 --> 41:49.160
you decided to do the trade for him

41:49.160 --> 41:50.690
to make up for your mistake?

41:52.320 --> 41:53.030
Am I right?

41:55.630 --> 41:57.360
Let me tell you the latest news:

41:58.760 --> 42:00.760
Zhou Rong confessed to everything.

42:13.440 --> 42:13.880
Chief.

42:13.920 --> 42:14.230
Chief.

42:14.230 --> 42:14.630
You...

42:14.960 --> 42:16.020
Excuse me. Wait up.

42:16.070 --> 42:16.930
What happened?

42:17.000 --> 42:17.550
Zhou Qi is here.

42:17.550 --> 42:18.920
She provided an important clue.

42:18.920 --> 42:20.320
Before Lu Yibo went for the deal,

42:20.320 --> 42:20.880
he asked her...

42:20.880 --> 42:22.810
To go look for Lang Bowen directly.

42:24.110 --> 42:25.630
Lu Yibo confessed everything.

42:25.630 --> 42:26.560
What did you say?

42:26.880 --> 42:27.500
Chief.

42:27.590 --> 42:28.520
-Chief.
-You...

42:28.590 --> 42:29.650
Excuse me. Wait up.

42:30.230 --> 42:31.490
Hu Jianren confessed.

42:31.550 --> 42:32.410
What did he say?

42:32.430 --> 42:34.190
He basically evidenced
what Zhou Rong said.

42:34.190 --> 42:34.960
He said Captain Ye's death

42:34.960 --> 42:36.110
has nothing to do with them.

42:36.110 --> 42:36.760
They also told us

42:36.760 --> 42:38.160
how they killed Xiaofei.

42:41.030 --> 42:41.630
Help me up.

42:42.820 --> 42:44.670
We'll go interrogate Lang Bowen right now.

42:44.670 --> 42:45.110
Sorry.

42:45.150 --> 42:46.150
What did you say just now?

42:46.150 --> 42:47.740
You need to stay in bed.

42:48.190 --> 42:49.150
I'll go interrogate them first.
